* A6_proposed_dem_mirror_phase1, testbench A_ac
* LTspice netlist (PTM 90 nm). Open in LTspice (File > Open, all files) and Run.
* AC at Iin = 10 uA: input impedance = V(inn) for the 1 A AC source; current gain = I(Vo).
.include ptm90.lib
Vdd vdd 0 1
Vcn vcn 0 0.42
Vo out 0 0.5
Ibf vdd y 2e-06
M1C y G1 x 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
MA da y 0 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
Vjoin inn x 0
M2C out G2 x2 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
MB db y 0 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
Ibo vdd out 2e-06
Ia1 vdd G1 2e-07
Ia2 vdd G2 2e-07
MA1 a1 x 0 0 nmos90 W=8u L=360n
MA2 a2 x2 0 0 nmos90 W=8u L=360n
Cc1 G1 0 0.3p
Cc2 G2 0 0.3p
Vcb vcb 0 0.45
MK1 G1 vcb a1 0 nmos90 W=2u L=360n
MK2 G2 vcb a2 0 nmos90 W=2u L=360n
Vp1 p1 0 1
Vp2 p2 0 0
MS1 da p1 x 0 nmos90 W=4u L=0.1u
MS2 db p1 x2 0 nmos90 W=4u L=0.1u
MS3 da p2 x2 0 nmos90 W=4u L=0.1u
MS4 db p2 x 0 nmos90 W=4u L=0.1u
Iin 0 inn 10u AC 1
.ac dec 40 1k 10G
.meas AC rin_1k FIND mag(V(inn)) AT=1k
.meas AC bw_3dB WHEN mag(I(Vo))=0.7071 FALL=1
.backanno
.end
